# Data + model artifacts (regenerated by ingestion / training scripts).
# Corpora are reproducible: `marsa-ingest fixtures` offline, or the live
# ingestors where egress is permitted. The provenance manifests are the thing
# worth keeping, and those are exported into frontend/src/data/.
data/raw/
data/processed/
data/.http-cache/
# Built by `marsa-index build` — BM25 pickle, vector dump, manifest. Fully
# reproducible from the corpora; the manifest is published into
# frontend/src/data/ingestion-report.json, which IS committed.
data/index/
data/*.pkl
artifacts/
*.joblib

